t followed by vastly improved living standards and the birth of entirely new industries that were unimaginable before. AI isn't just replacing tasks; it is augmenting human capability, creating entirely new categories of work we cannot yet envision, leading to more fulfilling careers. True societal resilience means embracing rapid adaptation, not clinging to the past. Our policies must facilitate this evolution through dynamic re-skilling initiatives, empowering workers to seize these future opportunities, rather than fighting an inevitable and beneficial transformation.",
